# LEDGE seal ritual in Unlambda — prints a WORM receipt.
#
# Unlambda evaluation is strict, so printing nests in REVERSE:
# "`.o`.l`.l`.e`.H`i" prints "Hello" — the innermost application
# evaluates (and prints) first.
#
# This program prints:
#   LEDGE
#   SEAL
#   decision=42

`r`.2`.4`.=`.n`.o`.i`.s`.i`.c`.e`.d`r`.L`.A`.E`.S`r`.E`.G`.D`.E`.Li
